      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AZZURRO (8) showed strong early pace and proved too slick around this track over 525m in 29.81, claiming a Mix 6/7 by 9 lengths. Will go close again if runs up to latest. ALGEBRA (2) finished second (29.85) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. The form from his last run stacks up well. Should play a prominent role. PAW BRUTUS (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing eighth (30.44) in a Grade 5 at Sandown. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Should be about the money. MORAINE SARA (1) is always hard to beat when drawn in this box.",
